A: How do you say to my brother in Russian, or with my mum?
    draw masha masha_name bro bro_name

A: Since lesson eight you've said мой брат. Today my goes into the cases.
    draw ref8

    erase ref8 bro bro_name

A: Tom meets Masha in the street. Listen to her answer.
    draw tom tom_name walk

A: Ма́ша, куда́ ты идёшь?
    draw balloon_t caption false

    draw balloon

    ask "Where is Masha going, and who with?" voice b gloss "моему́, мое́й: my" options ["to her mum's, with her brother","to her brother's, with her dad","to her brother's, with her mum"] correct 3
        listen: К моему́ бра́ту. Я иду́ с мое́й ма́мой.
        right: To her brother's, with her mum.
        wrong: Listen for бра́ту and ма́мой: к goes with her brother, с with her mum.

    erase walk balloon balloon_t

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

    draw s1 s2

A: К бра́ту you know from lesson fifty-seven: к, and the to-ending у.
    highlight s1_w_3 color #8a5fa8 part у$

A: And my goes along with it: not мой, but моему́, with the to-ending of its own.
    highlight s1_w_2 color #8a5fa8 part ему$

A: Ма́мой is the with-ending of lesson thirty-six.
    highlight s2_w_5 color #2f6b8f part ой$

A: And next to ма́мой, my says мое́й.
    highlight s2_w_4 color #2f6b8f part ей$

    erase s1 s2

B: К моему́ бра́ту. К мое́й ма́ме.
    draw h_he h_she c1 r1h r1s

B: С мои́м бра́том. С мое́й ма́мой.
    draw c2 r2h r2s

B: У моего́ бра́та. У мое́й ма́мы.
    draw c3 r3h r3s

A: Моего́ ends like большо́го, and the г sounds like в again, as in кого́.
    highlight r3h color #1a8a8a part его$

B: О моём бра́те. О мое́й ма́ме.
    draw c4 r4h r4s

A: Now read down the she side: мое́й every time. One form for all four of these.
    highlight r1s r2s r3s r4s color #3d3833 part мое́й effect underline

A: The he side has four: моему́, мои́м, моего́, моём. Like big in lesson fifty-eight, my goes into the noun's case.
    highlight r1h r2h r3h r4h color #3d3833 effect underline

    hide board

A: Твой goes the same way as мой: приве́т твоему́ бра́ту, приве́т твое́й ма́ме.
    text tv1 "Приве́т твоему́ бра́ту!" say "Приве́т твоему́ бра́ту!" colors {"ему$":"#8a5fa8","у$":"#8a5fa8"} x 500 y 520 font_size 56
    text tv2 "Приве́т твое́й ма́ме!" say "Приве́т твое́й ма́ме!" colors {"ей$":"#8a5fa8","е$":"#8a5fa8"} x 500 y 400 font_size 56

    erase tv1 tv2

A: But his and her, его́ and её, never change: с его́ дру́гом, у её ма́мы.
    text e1 "с его́ дру́гом" say "с его́ дру́гом" x 500 y 540 font_size 56
    text e2 "у её ма́мы" say "у её ма́мы" x 500 y 440 font_size 56

    erase e1 e2

A: Last, свой, one's own. Ма́ша звони́т своему́ бра́ту: Masha phones her own brother.
    icon sv_m size 150 set twemoji x 230 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon sv_b size 150 set twemoji x 770 y 470 or ["child"] icon_look picture of boy
    text sv_bn "брат" #8f887c x 770 y 360 font_size 32
    text sv1 "Ма́ша звони́т своему́ бра́ту." say "Ма́ша звони́т своему́ бра́ту." x 500 y 300 font_size 52

A: Её бра́ту there would mean someone else's brother.
    highlight sv1 color #c9871a part своему́ effect underline

    erase sv_m sv_b sv_bn sv1

    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

B: Ве́чером Том звони́т Ма́ше.
    icon phone size 70 set twemoji x 880 y 270 or ["telephone"] icon_look picture of "mobile phone"
    icon phone_m size 70 set twemoji x 120 y 270 or ["telephone"] icon_look picture of "mobile phone"

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Ма́ша, что ты де́лаешь?","gloss":"Masha, what are you doing?"},{"by":"b","text":"Пишу́ моему́ бра́ту.","gloss":"I'm writing to my brother."},{"by":"a","text":"А где он сейча́с?","gloss":"And where is he now?"},{"by":"b","text":"У ба́бушки, с его́ дру́гом.","gloss":"At grandma's, with his friend."},{"by":"a","text":"Приве́т твоему́ бра́ту!","gloss":"Say hi to your brother!"},{"by":"b","text":"Спаси́бо! И приве́т твое́й ма́ме!","gloss":"Thanks! And say hi to your mum!"}] practice true size 1.6

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name phone phone_m

    icon q_bro size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["child"] icon_look picture of boy

    quiz "Masha phones her brother. Я звоню́ ___ бра́ту. Which word fills the gap?" reveal.text "Я звоню́ моему́ бра́ту." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Моему́: you phone to someone, so the to-ending, on my and on бра́ту.
        wrong: Звоню́ takes the to-ending, on my too: моему́.
        * моего́
        * мое́й
        + моему́

    erase q_bro

    icon q_cafe size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["teacup without handle"] icon_look picture of "hot beverage"

    quiz "Tom says: I'm at the café with my mum. Я в кафе́ с ___ ма́мой. Which is right?" reveal.text "Я в кафе́ с мое́й ма́мой." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Мое́й: ма́ма is a she-word, and with her it's мое́й.
        wrong: Ма́ма is a she-word, and the she side says мое́й every time.
        + мое́й
        * моя́
        * мои́м

    erase q_cafe

    icon q_cat size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["man","person"] icon_look picture of "man raising hand"

    quiz "Ivan's friend is at grandma's too. Grandma is with his friend: Ба́бушка с ___ дру́гом." reveal.text "Ба́бушка с его́ дру́гом." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Его́: his never changes, whatever the case.
        wrong: His and her never change: it stays его́.
        * ему́
        + его́
        * им

    erase q_cat

    icon q_phone size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["telephone"] icon_look picture of "mobile phone"

    ask "Masha's off to her brother's. Send him a hi." say_it "Приве́т твоему́ бра́ту!" gloss "Hi to your brother!" voice a show cue test t1
    voice a

    erase q_phone

A: Приве́т твоему́ бра́ту!
    icon q_tom size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 500 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man
    text q_say "Приве́т твоему́ бра́ту!" say "Приве́т твоему́ бра́ту!" colors {"ему$":"#8a5fa8","у$":"#8a5fa8"} x 500 y 320 font_size 60

    erase q_tom q_say

    icon q_walk size 160 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["person walking"] icon_look picture of footprints

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type: I'm going to my brother's." answer ["я иду к моему брату","иду к моему брату"] reveal.text "Я иду́ к моему́ бра́ту." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Я иду́ к моему́ бра́ту: к, and the to-ending on my and on brother.
        wrong: Start with я иду́ к, then my and brother, both in the to-form.

    erase q_walk

    icon score_woman size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman

B: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase score_woman

    show board

A: So my goes into the case with its noun: моему́ бра́ту, с мое́й ма́мой, у моего́ бра́та. Твой does the same, and его́ and её never change.
    highlight r1h r2s r3h color #3d3833 effect underline

    erase board

B: Я иду́ к моему́ бра́ту! Пока́!
    icon end_masha size 170 set twemoji x 380 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon end_bro size 150 set twemoji x 620 y 470 or ["child"] icon_look picture of boy
    text end_say "Я иду́ к моему́ бра́ту! Пока́!" say "Я иду́ к моему́ бра́ту! Пока́!" x 500 y 290 font_size 50

    erase end_masha end_bro end_say

A: Next time, a story: Ivan's birthday, день рожде́ния Ива́на.
